            <h2>Become a Monthly Motivator!</h2>
            <br/>
            <p>In honor of Cara’s 30th anniversary in 2021, we are looking to add 30 new friends to our Monthly Motivators community! 
             By giving just a little each month, you will make a big impact in our job seekers lives. Plus, as part of our anniversary celebration, 
             our friends, the Quirk Family, have agreed to a special $10,000 match that will be activated when we secure our 30 Motivators for 30 years! 
             <b>If you establish a recurring donation before June 1, your gift will be matched dollar for dollar, doubling your impact all year long!</b></p> 
            <p>As a Monthly Motivator, your recurring gifts are an essential part of pushing Cara's mission forward. Your generosity provides reliable 
             support for the life-changing transformations that happen at Cara every day!</p>
            <p>To keep you connected, you will receive exclusive and behind the scenes updates on all things Cara, including, but not limited to, 
             transformation stories made possible through your giving, major announcements, and interviews with Cara participants and community leaders. 
             You will also receive a special end-of-year giving and impact report.</p>
            <p>Every dollar makes a difference and every job begins a path to success. <i>Thank you for considering becoming a Monthly Motivator with your 
             recurring gift to Cara!</i></p>
            <br/>
            <br/>
            <p>
                <b>For current recurring donors who are updating their information or upgrading their amount:</b>
             Please select your new giving level and fill out the rest of the form. Today's date will be your new payment date (for example,
             if today is the 25th, your next gift will be charged on the 25th of next month).
            </p>
            <p>If you have any questions about recurring gifts, please contact Carmen Taylor at ctaylor@carachicago.org or (312) 798-3331.</p>
            <br/>
            <p>To make a
                <b>ONE TIME</b>
             donation, please visit our 
                 <apex:outputLink value="https://carachicago.org/donate/" id="theLink0" target="_blank"> donations page.</apex:outputLink>
            </p>
             
